{"4203370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hi-Fi Roller", "steam_appid": 4203370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203370/extras/7c9938c627d35cec58756e607bef21f3.avif?t=1788057278\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203370/extras_big/7c9938c627d35cec58756e607bef21f3.webp?t=1788057278 width=1560 height=315 /></span>Roll, jump, and race through a tinkerer’s workshop turned obstacle course. Master a vast miniature world of circuit boards, wires, and contraptions in this photo-realistic marble platformer built for skill and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi-Fi graphics✨, Lo-Fi beats 🎧, all chill vibes😎.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🛣️ Bumpy Roads</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nobody said it would be completely smooth rolling. There are many obstacles that will get in your way. Roll, Die, Repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203370/extras/a4b1711c59e7a7768bfdfb58210c2a74.poster.avif?t=1788057278\" width=800 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203370/extras/a4b1711c59e7a7768bfdfb58210c2a74.webm?t=1788057278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🏁 Will You Rise to the Top?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score high in time trials. Compete globally. Top the leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203370/extras/46efde58f083f2c897fa6661e7c2c125.poster.avif?t=1788057278\" width=800 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203370/extras/46efde58f083f2c897fa6661e7c2c125.webm?t=1788057278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🔓 Unlock Them All</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get all achievements. Earn all badges. Unlock all marbles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203370/extras/f5131f38b2b2eb2c57b038a17836b789.poster.avif?t=1788057278\" width=800 height=253 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203370/extras/f5131f38b2b2eb2c57b038a17836b789.webm?t=1788057278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features and Roadmap</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 uniquely themed worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable Marbles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time Trials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Badges and Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lo-Fi Beats </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203370/extras/7c9938c627d35cec58756e607bef21f3.avif?t=1788057278\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203370/extras_big/7c9938c627d35cec58756e607bef21f3.webp?t=1788057278 width=1560 height=315 /></span>Roll, jump, and race through a tinkerer’s workshop turned obstacle course. Master a vast miniature world of circuit boards, wires, and contraptions in this photo-realistic marble platformer built for skill and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi-Fi graphics✨, Lo-Fi beats 🎧, all chill vibes😎.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🛣️ Bumpy Roads</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nobody said it would be completely smooth rolling. There are many obstacles that will get in your way. Roll, Die, Repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203370/extras/a4b1711c59e7a7768bfdfb58210c2a74.poster.avif?t=1788057278\" width=800 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203370/extras/a4b1711c59e7a7768bfdfb58210c2a74.webm?t=1788057278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🏁 Will You Rise to the Top?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score high in time trials. Compete globally. Top the leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203370/extras/46efde58f083f2c897fa6661e7c2c125.poster.avif?t=1788057278\" width=800 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203370/extras/46efde58f083f2c897fa6661e7c2c125.webm?t=1788057278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🔓 Unlock Them All</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get all achievements. Earn all badges. Unlock all marbles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203370/extras/f5131f38b2b2eb2c57b038a17836b789.poster.avif?t=1788057278\" width=800 height=253 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.stea